{================================================================================
 Script Name : _Live_Adaptive_Farmer_v19_8_BreakoutLong
 MC Load Name: STRATEGY_WILLY_LONG_BREAKOUT_C
 Description : L1+L3 Hybrid - L3 entry + L1 StopProfit philosophy (A/B engine)
 Version     : v19.8 + Pre-Trail SP + HolidayFlat_v3 + FrozenSL + ImmediateStop
 Symbol      : TXF1 (Taiwan Stock Index Futures Front Month)
 Platform    : MultiCharts 9.0 PowerLanguage x64
 Timeframe   : Data1 = 15M / Data2 = Daily / Data3 = Weekly

 CHANGELOG:
   v19.6  Prior production: God Mode + Daily Commander + Weekly AND Filter
          + Scale-Out + MFE 3-tier dynamic trail.

   v19.7  (2026-06-13) Three structural fixes (safety upgrades):
          DOW=7 dead code removed; HolidayFlat_v3 added; FrozenSL added.

   v19.8  (2026-06-13) PRE-TRAIL STOPPROFIT MODULE (A/B engine,
          input-switched, defaults OFF = regression-safe to v19.7):

          USER REQUEST:
            L5 is a hybrid - L3 entry (box bottom/mid catch) with
            extension intent (trail to ride breakouts). v19.7 had
            L3 entry but NOT L1's "don't give back profit you've
            already earned" philosophy. Old-Excel evidence:
              - 58 trades with MFE>0 ended <=0
              - 1,826,000 NTD wasted (per contract, 4.8 years)
              - Worst case (2024-05-03): MFE +244 pts -> BE -10 pts
                (244 pts entirely given back via BL_BE protection
                that only locks 0 profit, not peak retention)
            v19.7 BL_BE = EntryPrice (locks 0 profit)
            v19.8 BL_SP = EntryPrice + Peak * (1 - Retain pct)
                          (locks % of peak profit, L1-style)

          INSPIRATION (L1 V2.6 StopProfit module ported):
            stopProfitPoints_Long(250), profitReturnPrcnt_Long(55)
            Floor = EntryPrice + posbleProfit_Long * (1 - 55/100)
            Close-based peak tracking, never disarms once flat.

          MECHANISM (close-based, never disarms until flat):
            1. Track v_Peak_Profit = max(close - EntryPrice).
            2. Once v_Peak_Profit >= SP_Trigger_Pts: v_SP_Armed = true.
            3. v_SP_Floor = EntryPrice + v_Peak_Profit *
                            (1 - SP_Retain_Pct / 100).
            4. SP floor used as:
               - Stage 1 (full position): replaces base initial SL
                 IF v_SP_Floor > base SL. Label switches to BL_SP_*.
               - Stage 2/3 (post scale-out): replaces BL_BE
                 floor (EntryPrice) IF v_SP_Floor > EntryPrice.
                 Trail still wins if v_Dynamic_Stop > v_SP_Floor.
            5. Priority: Trail > SP > BE > base SL (highest stop
               wins for LONG = tightest floor).
            6. Stop labels are mutually exclusive per leg per bar:
               Stage 1: BL_SP_Bot vs BL_SL_Bot (one or the other)
               Stage 2/3: BL_Trail_Bot vs BL_SP_Bot vs BL_BE_Bot
               Same for Mid leg.

          INPUT SWITCHES (all default to OFF = v19.7 behavior):
            SP_Trigger_Pts(0)    { 0 = off. Try 60/80/100 in A/B. }
            SP_Retain_Pct(50)    { 0-100. L1 uses 55, L5 starts 50. }

          NAMED VARIANTS for MC9 A/B testing:
            A baseline    : SP=0 (= v19.7 regression check)
            B SP-Aggressive : SP=60, Retain=50 (early protection)
            C SP-Mid      : SP=80, Retain=50
            D SP-Conservative : SP=100, Retain=50 (high threshold)
            E SP-LessRetain : SP=80, Retain=40 (more giveback room)
            F SP-L1-Like  : SP=100, Retain=55 (mirror L1)

          NEW EXIT LABELS:
            BL_SP_Bot, BL_SP_Mid (mutually exclusive with BL_SL /
            BL_BE / BL_Trail on the same leg/bar)

          ACCEPTANCE per variant (per L4 v14.2 framework):
            PASS: net > v19.7 AND BL_SP WR >= 50 pct AND Top-10
                  winner retention >= 80 pct AND MDD not worse
                  by > 10 pct
            FAIL: BL_SP WR < 30 pct (L3/L4 trap reborn), OR
                  Top-10 retention < 70 pct, OR net < v19.7

          L4 v14.2 LESSON BAKED IN:
            L4 BE/SP failed because direct attachment after entry
            with no scale-out cushion truncated multi-stage
            winners. L5 differs:
              - Scale-out (40 pct) already locks partial profit.
              - SP applies to remaining 60 pct runner.
              - Trail still wins when active.
              - So SP truncation risk is on runner only, not the
                full position.
            But the trap can still reborn - hence the A/B test.

          REFERENCES:
            strategies/live/L1_TrendLong.pla - V2.6 SP source
            docs/L4_v142_variant_results.md  - what to avoid

          DEPLOY ONLY WHEN FLAT. Production default = OFF.

   v19.7  (2026-06-13) Three structural fixes (no logic change to
          God Mode engine; safety + correctness upgrades):

   FIX 1 - DayOfWeek = 7 DEAD CODE REMOVED:
     v19.6 had 3 references to DayOfWeek(Date) = 7, but in
     PowerLanguage / MultiCharts DayOfWeek returns 0-6
     (Sun=0, Mon=1, ..., Sat=6). The value 7 is NEVER true.
     - Line 103 (entry block on DOW=7) was harmless no-op
       (Sunday has no TXF1 bars anyway).
     - Lines 109-114 (BL_SatClose_Bot/Mid market exit at
       DOW=7 + Time>=400) was DEAD CODE. The original intent
       was to force-flat on Saturday morning (TXF1 night
       session ends Sat 05:00) but this never fired.
     Verified against older AND backtest (4.8yr / 152 trades):
       BL_SatClose_Bot = 0 fires, BL_SatClose_Mid = 0 fires.
     v19.7 removes all three DOW=7 references. The existing
     DOW=6 + Time>=1330 entry block (which IS correct
     Saturday) is preserved. Weekend gap risk relies on
     trail/SL catching the runner, same as v19.6 effective
     behavior (since the SatClose was always dead).

   FIX 2 - HOLIDAY FLAT RULE v3 added:
     v19.6 had ZERO holiday protection. v19.7 installs the
     same module that L1/L2/L3/L4 already use:
       - Holiday_Tail[80] = 63 TAIFEX-verified dates (shared
         registry with L1/L2/L3/L4; byte-identical).
       - Tail bars (00:00-05:00 of "last trading day + 1
         calendar day") block new entries via v_Allow_Entry
         AND force-flat any position from Holiday_Flat_Time
         (15M grid = 04:15 trigger, retries 04:30/04:45,
         flat before 05:00).
       - Registry_Valid_Until(1270101) fail-safe: beyond
         this date block entries + flatten (BL_RegistryEnd)
         + 30-day red chart warning.
       - Manual_Kill_Switch(false) for typhoon-class
         unscheduled closures (BL_Kill).
     History impact: 0 historical violations in 152-trade
     older Excel (forward protection only). First live test
     = 2026-06-18 Dragon Boat eve.

   FIX 3 - FROZEN INITIAL STOP added:
     v19.6 had the same ATR-drift bug as L1 V2.5-era and
     L4 v14.0-era: v_ATR_Buffer = v_Current_ATR * ATR_Stop_Mult
     recomputed every 15M bar, so the initial stop drifts
     with ATR(35) and changes on chart reload.
       - Freeze_SL_On(true): on entry bar, lock v_Frozen_ATR
         = ATR-at-entry. The initial stop becomes a function
         of v_Frozen_ATR (stable) instead of v_Current_ATR
         (drifting).
       - Trail layer keeps using v_Current_ATR by design
         (trail should track current volatility).
       - Set Freeze_SL_On = false to replicate v19.6 dynamic.

   WHAT THIS ROUND DOES NOT TOUCH (deferred):
     - BL_BE (post-scale-out breakeven floor) mechanism.
       L4 v14.2 A/B proved BE can amputate multi-stage
       winners; L5 has built-in BE since v19.x with no A/B.
       Future round may test L5 with BE off vs on. NOT done
       here per "do not refactor beyond scope" rule.
     - Night entry filter (L4 Path A). L5 older data shows
       02-04 entries are +87,800 net (12 trades, 7 wins),
       UNLIKE L4 (-120,800). Night block would harm L5.
     - Scale-out percentage and trail tier multipliers.

 PERFORMANCE BASELINE (from L5 annotated v19.6 - to be
 re-verified after v19.7 MC9 deployment with fresh Excel):
   Net Profit    : 1,713,000 TWD
   Profit Factor : 2.136
   Win Rate      : 52.47%
   MDD           : -193,200 (-16.61%)
   Total Trades  : 162
   Backtest      : ~4.8 years

   v19.8+ (2026-06-18) P3b Immediate Stop Guard:
          - SetStopLoss = MC engine-level stop, active on entry
            bar (no IOG dependency). Closes the unprotected window.
          - Distance = AbsValue(Close - (Box_Btm - ATR*4.5)) *
            BigPointValue. Uses the WIDER Bot-leg stop for both
            entry legs (Bot and Mid). Conservative: Mid-leg entries
            get more buffer than strictly needed, but ensures
            disaster protection for all entries.
          - Called only when flat (MP<=0) inside consolidation
            block -> freezes when position opens.
          - Dormant backup once custom stops tighten.
          - Deploy only when flat.
================================================================================}

inputs:
    { [SEC-1] Data2 Commander Settings }
    Lookback_Bars(4),
    Range_Shrink_Rate(0.6),
    Daily_MA_Len(60),

    { [SEC-2] Zone A Entry Filter }
    Min_RR_Bull(1.1),

    { [SEC-3] Risk Management }
    ATR_Length(35),
    ATR_Stop_Mult(4.5),
    FrontRun_Ticks(5),
    Time_Stop_Bars(31),

    { [SEC-4] Scale-Out Settings }
    ScaleOut_Percent(0.4),

    { [SEC-5] God Mode: Relative MFE Engine }
    Trail_Start_Mult(2.5),
    MFE_ATR_Tier_1(3.0),
    MFE_ATR_Tier_2(6.0),
    MFE_ATR_Tier_3(10.0),

    { [SEC-6] Data3 (Weekly) Filter Settings }
    Weekly_MA_Fast(20),
    Weekly_MA_Slow(60),

    { [SEC-7] v19.7 Frozen Initial SL }
    Freeze_SL_On(true),            { PRODUCTION: lock ATR at entry; false = v19.6 dynamic }

    { [SEC-8] v19.7 Holiday Flat Rule v3 (Iron Rule 2026-06-13) }
    Holiday_Flat_Time(415),        { 15M grid: 04:15 trigger, retries 04:30/04:45 }
    Registry_Valid_Until(1270101), { verified holiday-registry horizon; bump each Q4 }
    Manual_Kill_Switch(false),

    { [SEC-8b] Monthly Settlement Flat (2026-06-17 added) }
    Settlement_Flat_Time(1230),    { 12:30 trigger before 13:30 settlement (3rd Wed) }

    { [SEC-9] v19.8 Pre-Trail StopProfit (L1 SP philosophy, A/B engine).
              VERDICT 2026-06-13: All 5 SP variants (B/C/D/E/F)
              FAILED net-vs-baseline. Best variant D was -14 pct
              net + Top-10 retention only 50 pct. SP permanently
              disabled in production. Code preserved for
              archival/research only. See L5_v198_variant_results.md }
    SP_Trigger_Pts(0),             { PERMANENT 0 = off. All A/B variants FAILED.
                                     B/C/D/E/F all killed 3 mega-winners
                                     (2026-04-07 +376K, 2026-03-31 +177K,
                                     2026-03-12 +131K) reducing them to +7~+38K. }
    SP_Retain_Pct(50);             { inert while SP_Trigger_Pts = 0 }

variables:
    { [SEC-0] Time filter state }
    v_Allow_Entry(true),

    { [SEC-1] Commander state }
    v_Ref_High(0),
    v_Ref_Low(0),
    v_Curr_Range(0),
    v_Ref_Range(0),
    v_is_in_consolidation(false),
    v_Box_Top(0),
    v_Box_Btm(0),
    v_Daily_MA(0),
    v_Trend_Dir(0),

    { [SEC-2] Execution geometry }
    v_Current_ATR(0),
    v_Mid_Line(0),
    v_Expected_Reward(0),
    v_Expected_Risk(0),
    v_Current_RR(0),
    v_TickSize(MinMove / PriceScale),
    v_Target_Bot(0),
    v_Target_Mid(0),

    { [SEC-3] Cached ATR multiples }
    v_ATR_Buffer(0),
    v_ATR_Trail_Start(0),
    v_ATR_Tier1(0),
    v_ATR_Tier2(0),
    v_ATR_Tier3(0),

    { [SEC-4] Position sizing }
    v_ScaleOut_Size(0),

    { [SEC-5] MFE Engine state }
    v_Highest_Since_Entry(0),
    v_Trail_Active(false),
    v_Current_MFE_Distance(0),
    v_Dynamic_Trail_Mult(3.0),
    v_Dynamic_Stop(0),

    { [SEC-6] Data3 Weekly Filter }
    v_Weekly_MA_Fast(0),
    v_Weekly_MA_Slow(0),
    v_Weekly_Filter(false),

    { [SEC-7] v19.7 Frozen Initial SL }
    v_SL_Locked(false),
    v_Frozen_ATR(0),
    v_Frozen_ATR_Buffer(0),

    { [SEC-8] v19.7 Holiday Flat Rule v3 }
    v_Holiday_Block(false),
    v_Registry_Expired(false),
    Registry_Warn_ID(-1),
    hidx(0),

    { [SEC-8b] Settlement Day state }
    v_Settlement_Day(false),

    { [SEC-9] v19.8 Pre-Trail StopProfit }
    v_Peak_Profit(0),              { close-based MFE in points }
    v_SP_Armed(false),
    v_SP_Floor(0),
    v_Bot_Base_Stop(0),            { Stage 1 base SL for Bot leg }
    v_Mid_Base_Stop(0),            { Stage 1 base SL for Mid leg }

    { [SEC-10] Manual trade annotations }
    v_ManualAnnot_Drawn(false),
    v_ManualAnnot_ID1(-1),
    v_ManualAnnot_ID2(-1),
    v_ManualAnnot_ID3(-1),
    v_ManualAnnot_ID4(-1);

arrays:
    Holiday_Tail[80](0);

{ ==========================================
  [SEC--1] HOLIDAY TAIL REGISTRY (TAIFEX-verified, shared
  with L1/L2/L3/L4). Holiday_Tail = last trading day + 1
  calendar day = the date stamped on the 00:00-05:00 tail
  bars of the final night session before each closure.
  ========================================== }

if CurrentBar = 1 then begin
    Holiday_Tail[1]  = 1190913;  Holiday_Tail[2]  = 1191010;
    Holiday_Tail[3]  = 1200101;
    { 2020 } Holiday_Tail[4]  = 1200121;  Holiday_Tail[5]  = 1200228;
    Holiday_Tail[6]  = 1200402;  Holiday_Tail[7]  = 1200501;
    Holiday_Tail[8]  = 1200625;  Holiday_Tail[9]  = 1201001;
    Holiday_Tail[10] = 1201009;  Holiday_Tail[11] = 1210101;
    { 2021 } Holiday_Tail[12] = 1210206;  Holiday_Tail[13] = 1210227;
    Holiday_Tail[14] = 1210402;  Holiday_Tail[15] = 1210612;
    Holiday_Tail[16] = 1210918;  Holiday_Tail[17] = 1211009;
    Holiday_Tail[18] = 1211231;
    { 2022 } Holiday_Tail[19] = 1220127;  Holiday_Tail[20] = 1220226;
    Holiday_Tail[21] = 1220402;  Holiday_Tail[22] = 1220430;
    Holiday_Tail[23] = 1220603;  Holiday_Tail[24] = 1220909;
    Holiday_Tail[25] = 1221008;  Holiday_Tail[26] = 1221231;
    { 2023 } Holiday_Tail[27] = 1230118;  Holiday_Tail[28] = 1230225;
    Holiday_Tail[29] = 1230401;  Holiday_Tail[30] = 1230429;
    Holiday_Tail[31] = 1230622;  Holiday_Tail[32] = 1230929;
    Holiday_Tail[33] = 1231007;  Holiday_Tail[34] = 1231230;
    { 2024 } Holiday_Tail[35] = 1240206;  Holiday_Tail[36] = 1240228;
    Holiday_Tail[37] = 1240404;  Holiday_Tail[38] = 1240501;
    Holiday_Tail[39] = 1240608;  Holiday_Tail[40] = 1240917;
    Holiday_Tail[41] = 1241010;  Holiday_Tail[42] = 1250101;
    { 2025 (* pending vs 114-yr PDF) }
    Holiday_Tail[43] = 1250123;  Holiday_Tail[44] = 1250228;
    Holiday_Tail[45] = 1250403;  Holiday_Tail[46] = 1250501;
    Holiday_Tail[47] = 1250530;  Holiday_Tail[48] = 1250927;
    Holiday_Tail[49] = 1251004;  Holiday_Tail[50] = 1251010;
    Holiday_Tail[51] = 1251024;  Holiday_Tail[52] = 1251225;
    Holiday_Tail[53] = 1260101;
    { 2026 (verified: TAIFEX official 115-yr calendar) }
    Holiday_Tail[54] = 1260212;  Holiday_Tail[55] = 1260227;
    Holiday_Tail[56] = 1260403;  Holiday_Tail[57] = 1260501;
    Holiday_Tail[58] = 1260619;  Holiday_Tail[59] = 1260925;
    Holiday_Tail[60] = 1261009;  Holiday_Tail[61] = 1261024;
    Holiday_Tail[62] = 1261225;  Holiday_Tail[63] = 1270101;
    { 2027 CNY onward: rebuild from TAIFEX 116-yr calendar in Q4 2026 }
end;

v_Holiday_Block = false;

if Time <= 500 then begin
    for hidx = 1 to 80 begin
        if Date = Holiday_Tail[hidx] then
            v_Holiday_Block = true;
    end;
end;

v_Registry_Expired = false;

if Date > Registry_Valid_Until then begin
    v_Registry_Expired = true;
    v_Holiday_Block    = true;
end;

{ Monthly Settlement Day detection (3rd Wed of month) }
v_Settlement_Day = (DayOfWeek(Date) = 3) and
                   (DayOfMonth(Date) >= 15) and
                   (DayOfMonth(Date) <= 21);

if LastBarOnChart and
   DateToJulian(Date) >= DateToJulian(Registry_Valid_Until) - 30 then begin
    if Registry_Warn_ID < 0 then begin
        Registry_Warn_ID = Text_New(Date, Time, High + 400,
            "HOLIDAY REGISTRY EXPIRES " +
            NumToStr(Registry_Valid_Until, 0) +
            " - REBUILD FROM TAIFEX CALENDAR");
        Text_SetColor(Registry_Warn_ID, Red);
        Text_SetSize(Registry_Warn_ID, 14);
        Text_SetAttribute(Registry_Warn_ID, 1, true);
    end;
end;

{ ==========================================
  [SEC-0] TIME FILTER (v19.7: DayOfWeek=7 dead code removed)
  Active filters:
    - Dead-of-night 04:00-05:00 (low liquidity)
    - Saturday after 13:30 (no TXF1 weekend session anyway,
      but kept as belt-and-suspenders)
    - Holiday tail bars (via v_Holiday_Block, added below)
  ========================================== }

v_Allow_Entry = true;

if (Time >= 400) and (Time <= 500) then
    v_Allow_Entry = false;

if DayOfWeek(Date) = 6 and Time >= 1330 then
    v_Allow_Entry = false;

if v_Holiday_Block then
    v_Allow_Entry = false;

if v_Settlement_Day then
    v_Allow_Entry = false;

{ ==========================================
  [SEC-1] COMMANDER LOGIC (Data2 - Daily)
  ========================================== }

v_Ref_High   = Highest(High, Lookback_Bars)[1] of Data2;
v_Ref_Low    = Lowest(Low,   Lookback_Bars)[1] of Data2;
v_Curr_Range = (High of Data2) - (Low of Data2);
v_Ref_Range  = v_Ref_High - v_Ref_Low;
v_Daily_MA   = Average(Close, Daily_MA_Len) of Data2;

if Close of Data2 > v_Daily_MA then
    v_Trend_Dir = 1
else
    v_Trend_Dir = -1;

if (High of Data2 <= v_Ref_High) and (Low of Data2 >= v_Ref_Low) then begin
    if v_Ref_Range > 0 and (v_Curr_Range / v_Ref_Range <= Range_Shrink_Rate) then begin
        v_is_in_consolidation = true;
        v_Box_Top = v_Ref_High;
        v_Box_Btm = v_Ref_Low;
    end;
end;

if v_is_in_consolidation then begin
    if (High of Data2 > v_Box_Top) or (Low of Data2 < v_Box_Btm) then
        v_is_in_consolidation = false;
end;

{ ==========================================
  [SEC-2] ATR CACHE (Data1 - once per bar)
  ATR_Buffer used for initial stop and entry filter geometry.
  v19.7: when Freeze_SL_On is true and we're in position,
  v_ATR_Buffer (for initial stop) uses v_Frozen_ATR instead.
  ========================================== }

v_Current_ATR     = AvgTrueRange(ATR_Length);
v_ATR_Buffer      = v_Current_ATR * ATR_Stop_Mult;
v_ATR_Trail_Start = v_Current_ATR * Trail_Start_Mult;
v_ATR_Tier1       = v_Current_ATR * MFE_ATR_Tier_1;
v_ATR_Tier2       = v_Current_ATR * MFE_ATR_Tier_2;
v_ATR_Tier3       = v_Current_ATR * MFE_ATR_Tier_3;

{ ==========================================
  [SEC-6] WEEKLY FILTER LOGIC (Data3 - Weekly)
  ========================================== }

v_Weekly_MA_Fast = Average(Close, Weekly_MA_Fast) of Data3;
v_Weekly_MA_Slow = Average(Close, Weekly_MA_Slow) of Data3;

if (Close of Data3 > v_Weekly_MA_Fast) and
   (Close of Data3 > v_Weekly_MA_Slow) then
    v_Weekly_Filter = true
else
    v_Weekly_Filter = false;

{ ==========================================
  [SEC-3] ENTRY LOGIC (Data1 - 15min)
  Entries gated by:
    - v_is_in_consolidation (box exists)
    - v_Allow_Entry (time + holiday + DOW filters)
    - v_Trend_Dir = 1 (daily MA60 bullish)
    - v_Weekly_Filter (weekly AND filter)
    - v_Current_RR >= Min_RR_Bull
  ========================================== }

if v_is_in_consolidation and v_Box_Top > v_Box_Btm then begin

    v_Mid_Line        = (v_Box_Top + v_Box_Btm) / 2;
    v_Expected_Reward = (v_Box_Top - v_Box_Btm) / 2;
    v_Expected_Risk   = v_ATR_Buffer;

    if v_Expected_Risk > 0 then
        v_Current_RR = v_Expected_Reward / v_Expected_Risk
    else
        v_Current_RR = 0;

    v_Target_Bot = v_Mid_Line - (FrontRun_Ticks * v_TickSize);
    v_Target_Mid = v_Box_Top  - (FrontRun_Ticks * v_TickSize);

    { P3b: Immediate Stop Guard -- entry-bar protection (2026-06-18)
      SetStopLoss is MC engine-level: active on entry bar, no IOG dependency.
      Uses WIDER Bot-leg stop for both entry legs (conservative). }
    if MarketPosition <= 0 then
        SetStopLoss(AbsValue(Close - (v_Box_Btm - v_ATR_Buffer))
                    * BigPointValue);

    if MarketPosition = 0 and v_Allow_Entry then begin
        if (v_Trend_Dir = 1) and
           (v_Weekly_Filter = true) and
           (v_Current_RR >= Min_RR_Bull) then begin

            if (Close < v_Box_Btm) and
               (Close > v_Box_Btm - v_ATR_Buffer) then
                Buy ("BL_Entry_Bot") next bar at v_Box_Btm Stop;

            if (Close < v_Mid_Line) and
               (Close > v_Mid_Line - v_ATR_Buffer) then
                Buy ("BL_Entry_Mid") next bar at v_Mid_Line Stop;

        end;
    end;

    { ==========================================
      [SEC-4] EXIT LOGIC
      ========================================== }

    if MarketPosition = 1 then begin

        if v_Highest_Since_Entry = 0 then
            v_Highest_Since_Entry = EntryPrice;
        if High > v_Highest_Since_Entry then
            v_Highest_Since_Entry = High;

        v_Current_MFE_Distance = v_Highest_Since_Entry - EntryPrice;

        if High > v_Box_Top + v_ATR_Trail_Start then
            v_Trail_Active = true;

        { v19.7: Freeze ATR ONCE on entry bar }
        if Freeze_SL_On and v_SL_Locked = false then begin
            v_Frozen_ATR        = v_Current_ATR;
            v_Frozen_ATR_Buffer = v_Frozen_ATR * ATR_Stop_Mult;
            v_SL_Locked         = true;
        end;

        { v19.8: Close-based MFE peak + SP arming (L1 SP philosophy).
          Never disarms until flat. v_SP_Floor scales with peak. }
        if Close - EntryPrice > v_Peak_Profit then
            v_Peak_Profit = Close - EntryPrice;
        if SP_Trigger_Pts > 0 and v_Peak_Profit >= SP_Trigger_Pts then
            v_SP_Armed = true;
        if v_SP_Armed then
            v_SP_Floor = EntryPrice +
                (v_Peak_Profit * (1 - SP_Retain_Pct / 100));

        v_ScaleOut_Size = Round(MaxContracts * ScaleOut_Percent, 0);
        if MaxContracts > 1 and v_ScaleOut_Size = 0 then
            v_ScaleOut_Size = 1;

        { Priority 0: Holiday Iron Rule / Registry / Kill
          (Market-type, runs before stop/limit logic in PL engine) }
        if Manual_Kill_Switch then begin
            Sell ("BL_Kill_Bot") from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot") next bar at Market;
            Sell ("BL_Kill_Mid") from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid") next bar at Market;
        end else if v_Registry_Expired then begin
            Sell ("BL_RegistryEnd_Bot") from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot") next bar at Market;
            Sell ("BL_RegistryEnd_Mid") from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid") next bar at Market;
        end else if v_Holiday_Block and Time >= Holiday_Flat_Time then begin
            Sell ("BL_Holiday_Bot") from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot") next bar at Market;
            Sell ("BL_Holiday_Mid") from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid") next bar at Market;
        end else if v_Settlement_Day and Time >= Settlement_Flat_Time then begin
            Sell ("BL_Settlement_Bot") from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot") next bar at Market;
            Sell ("BL_Settlement_Mid") from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid") next bar at Market;
        end;

        { Stage 1: Full position }
        if CurrentContracts = MaxContracts then begin

            if v_ScaleOut_Size > 0 then begin
                Sell ("BL_TP_Bot") v_ScaleOut_Size contracts
                    from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot") next bar at v_Target_Bot Limit;
                Sell ("BL_TP_Mid") v_ScaleOut_Size contracts
                    from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid") next bar at v_Target_Mid Limit;
            end;

            { v19.7: base SL uses Frozen ATR Buffer when locked }
            if Freeze_SL_On and v_SL_Locked then begin
                v_Bot_Base_Stop = v_Box_Btm  - v_Frozen_ATR_Buffer;
                v_Mid_Base_Stop = v_Mid_Line - v_Frozen_ATR_Buffer;
            end else begin
                v_Bot_Base_Stop = v_Box_Btm  - v_ATR_Buffer;
                v_Mid_Base_Stop = v_Mid_Line - v_ATR_Buffer;
            end;

            { v19.8: emit BL_SP_* when SP binds higher than base SL,
              else BL_SL_* (mutually exclusive per leg per bar) }
            if v_SP_Armed and v_SP_Floor > v_Bot_Base_Stop then
                Sell ("BL_SP_Bot") CurrentContracts contracts
                    from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot")
                    next bar at v_SP_Floor Stop
            else
                Sell ("BL_SL_Bot") CurrentContracts contracts
                    from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot")
                    next bar at v_Bot_Base_Stop Stop;

            if v_SP_Armed and v_SP_Floor > v_Mid_Base_Stop then
                Sell ("BL_SP_Mid") CurrentContracts contracts
                    from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid")
                    next bar at v_SP_Floor Stop
            else
                Sell ("BL_SL_Mid") CurrentContracts contracts
                    from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid")
                    next bar at v_Mid_Base_Stop Stop;

            if BarsSinceEntry >= Time_Stop_Bars then begin
                Sell ("BL_TimeExit_Bot") from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot") next bar at Market;
                Sell ("BL_TimeExit_Mid") from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid") next bar at Market;
            end;

        end;

        { Stage 2 and 3: Partial position }
        if CurrentContracts < MaxContracts then begin

            if v_Trail_Active then begin

                if v_Current_MFE_Distance > v_ATR_Tier3 then
                    v_Dynamic_Trail_Mult = 0.8
                else if v_Current_MFE_Distance > v_ATR_Tier2 then
                    v_Dynamic_Trail_Mult = 1.5
                else if v_Current_MFE_Distance > v_ATR_Tier1 then
                    v_Dynamic_Trail_Mult = 2.0
                else
                    v_Dynamic_Trail_Mult = 3.0;

                v_Dynamic_Stop = v_Highest_Since_Entry -
                                 (v_Current_ATR * v_Dynamic_Trail_Mult);

                { v19.8 priority for runner: Trail > SP > BE }
                if v_Dynamic_Stop > MaxList(EntryPrice, v_SP_Floor) then begin
                    Sell ("BL_Trail_Bot") CurrentContracts contracts
                        from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot")
                        next bar at v_Dynamic_Stop Stop;
                    Sell ("BL_Trail_Mid") CurrentContracts contracts
                        from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid")
                        next bar at v_Dynamic_Stop Stop;
                end else if v_SP_Armed and v_SP_Floor > EntryPrice then begin
                    Sell ("BL_SP_Bot") CurrentContracts contracts
                        from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot")
                        next bar at v_SP_Floor Stop;
                    Sell ("BL_SP_Mid") CurrentContracts contracts
                        from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid")
                        next bar at v_SP_Floor Stop;
                end else begin
                    Sell ("BL_BE_Bot") CurrentContracts contracts
                        from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot")
                        next bar at EntryPrice Stop;
                    Sell ("BL_BE_Mid") CurrentContracts contracts
                        from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid")
                        next bar at EntryPrice Stop;
                end;

            end else begin
                { Trail not yet active. v19.8: SP > BE priority. }
                if v_SP_Armed and v_SP_Floor > EntryPrice then begin
                    Sell ("BL_SP_Bot") CurrentContracts contracts
                        from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot")
                        next bar at v_SP_Floor Stop;
                    Sell ("BL_SP_Mid") CurrentContracts contracts
                        from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid")
                        next bar at v_SP_Floor Stop;
                end else begin
                    Sell ("BL_BE_Bot") CurrentContracts contracts
                        from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot") next bar at EntryPrice Stop;
                    Sell ("BL_BE_Mid") CurrentContracts contracts
                        from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid") next bar at EntryPrice Stop;
                end;
            end;

        end;

    end;

end else begin
    if MarketPosition = 1 then begin
        Sell ("BL_BreakExit_Bot") from Entry ("BL_Entry_Bot") next bar at Market;
        Sell ("BL_BreakExit_Mid") from Entry ("BL_Entry_Mid") next bar at Market;
    end;
end;

{ ==========================================
  [ANNOTATION] Manual Exit 2026-06-25
  Micro-TXF 076: Buy 45732 x2 at 03:59 -> Sell 46990 x2 at 08:45
  ========================================== }
if v_ManualAnnot_Drawn = false and Date >= 1260625 then begin
    { Green dotted line: right edge of entry bar -> left edge of exit bar }
    v_ManualAnnot_ID1 = TL_New(1260625, 400, 45732,
        1260625, 845, 46990);
    TL_SetColor(v_ManualAnnot_ID1, Green);
    TL_SetStyle(v_ManualAnnot_ID1, 3);

    { MC native exit style: count above, signal name below }
    v_ManualAnnot_ID2 = Text_New(1260625, 845, 47060,
        "2");
    Text_SetColor(v_ManualAnnot_ID2, White);

    v_ManualAnnot_ID3 = Text_New(1260625, 845, 46990,
        "BL_TP_Bot");
    Text_SetColor(v_ManualAnnot_ID3, White);

    v_ManualAnnot_Drawn = true;
end;

{ ==========================================
  [SEC-5] STATE RESET (position flat)
  ========================================== }

if MarketPosition = 0 then begin
    v_Highest_Since_Entry = 0;
    v_Trail_Active        = false;
    v_Dynamic_Trail_Mult  = 3.0;
    v_SL_Locked           = false;
    v_Frozen_ATR          = 0;
    v_Frozen_ATR_Buffer   = 0;
    v_Peak_Profit         = 0;
    v_SP_Armed            = false;
    v_SP_Floor            = 0;
    v_Bot_Base_Stop       = 0;
    v_Mid_Base_Stop       = 0;
end;
